        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦅 ABOUT THE GAME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the feathered skins of winged avengers whose world has been taken over by greedy monsters! Mad Birds is an explosive mix of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flawless destruction physics (every brick is calculated with surgical precision)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical shots (where trajectory is an art and chaos is your ally)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crazy fun (the game can cause childish delight in adults)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mad Birds is a casual physics-based game in which the player uses a slingshot to launch birds at enemies and various buildings and destroy them. Enemies can be destroyed both by direct hits and by buildings falling on them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ 160+ levels with cinematic destruction - from flimsy glass boxes to stone castles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ 4 seasons in different styles are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Get the maximum number of stars and take first place in the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Accumulate energy for completing levels and spend it on various bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ New levels and seasons are added regularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ 5 disaster birds with superpowers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive bird (blows up everything, including the 4th wall)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed bird (accelerates to the speed of a meme)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Triple bird (yes, it has a personality disorder)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 STYLE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bright cartoon world where every frame is like eye candy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to complete all the levels and earn the maximum number of stars!</p>",
